   Original Repository: https://github.com/qtremors/cosmos
   Licensed under the Tremors Source License
   ```

3. **Maintain attribution permanently.** This credit must remain visible for the entire lifetime of Your project and **cannot be removed or obscured**, regardless of how significantly the code is modified.

4. **Preserve this license file** in all forks and Derivative Works.

**Failure to comply with attribution requirements immediately terminates Your rights under this license.**

